## AI Agent Reasoning

### Context
Firefox extension pages cannot use the existing SharedArrayBuffer-backed live stdin path.

### Decisions Made
- Use a native dialog for accessible focus management and Escape cancellation.
- Treat run preparation as distinct from running; only worker run-start enables Stop and live stdin routing.
- Cap UTF-8 input at 256 KiB and render user input only through textarea values/textContent.
- Disable compile actions while preparation is active to prevent duplicate worker work.

### Trade-offs
- Firefox users provide all stdin before execution, so program prompts may appear after input is entered.

